This license covers the *source code* of this repository only.

The photographs and the Unsplash Lite metadata are NOT covered by it and are
NOT redistributed here. `data/` is gitignored; the published artifacts contain
derived model outputs (embeddings) plus the display minimum needed to render a
result and credit its photographer. Photographs are hotlinked from Unsplash's
CDN, which is how Unsplash asks to be used.

  * Unsplash Lite dataset — https://unsplash.com/data  (terms permit use,
    prohibit redistributing the Licensed Data)
  * Unsplash License — https://unsplash.com/license
  * CLIP ViT-B/32 weights — MIT, OpenAI, via sentence-transformers

See the "Dataset & licensing" section of README.md for the reasoning, and
DECISIONS.md (Session 11) for the judgment call written out in full.
